20. Our specific questions, ones we we insist be answered in the clearest terms on the Affidavit are:
9th August 2023 912-OSWPL-17731-2023.DOC (a) whether MHADA at any time in recorded human history acquired CTS Nos.
148/129, 149 & 150;
(b) If so, when, from whom (i.e., who were the recorded owners of these three plots at the time), and in what manner?
(c) full details as available of the acquisition proceedings including details of all awards passed, compensation ordered and paid;
(d) whether that compensation was accepted and whether there were any further proceedings in that regard?;
(e) (5) whether following any such acquisition, if it took place, what steps were taken to update the land records in regard to these three plots.
